{%- doc -%}
  Materia Themes. A sample garment for the Boutique Rail section: a real photo
  of a garment, cut out, shown until a garment has its own pictures (when the
  section's Show sample garments is on). Your own pictures always replace it.

  @param {number} [index] - Which sample (0-7); defaults to kind
  @param {number} [kind] - Kept for older calls: used as the index when index is not given
  @param {string} view - 'side' (on the rail) or 'front' (on hover and in focus)
  @param {string} [sizes] - The sizes attribute for the picture

  @example
  {% render 'boutique-rail-sample', index: 0, view: 'front' %}
{%- enddoc -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Photo credits. Every sample is a public-domain (CC0 1.0) photograph from
  rawpixel's public domain collection, cut out and, for some, recoloured; no
  attribution is required, it is given here as a courtesy.
  1 Denim shirt              - "Demin shirt", rawpixel, CC0 1.0: https://www.rawpixel.com/image/6032758
  2 Wool coat, camel         - "Jacket hanger", rawpixel, CC0 1.0 (recoloured): https://www.rawpixel.com/image/6039264
  3 Knit, olive              - "Mail Shirt", rawpixel, CC0 1.0: https://www.rawpixel.com/image/8930556
  4 Overshirt, black         - "Demin shirt", rawpixel, CC0 1.0 (recoloured): https://www.rawpixel.com/image/6032758
  5 Wool coat, rose          - "Jacket hanger", rawpixel, CC0 1.0: https://www.rawpixel.com/image/6039264
  6 Knit, oat                - "Mail Shirt", rawpixel, CC0 1.0 (recoloured): https://www.rawpixel.com/image/8930556
  7 Overshirt, sage          - "Demin shirt", rawpixel, CC0 1.0 (recoloured): https://www.rawpixel.com/image/6032758
  8 Wool coat, navy          - "Jacket hanger", rawpixel, CC0 1.0 (recoloured): https://www.rawpixel.com/image/6039264
  License: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign n = index | default: kind | default: 0 | modulo: 8 | plus: 1
  if view == 'side'
    assign w = 336
    assign cls = 'brail__side'
  else
    assign w = 688
    assign cls = 'brail__front'
  endif
  assign file = 'brail-sample-' | append: n | append: '-' | append: view | append: '.webp'
-%}
<img class="{{ cls }} brail__photo" src="{{ file | asset_url }}" width="{{ w }}" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"{% if sizes %} sizes="{{ sizes }}"{% endif %}>
